flowchart TD
    D[Successful options run] --> P[Preview pinned draft and linked critic]
    C[Successful linked critic] --> P
    P --> H[Human reviews sources, hypotheses and critic concerns]
    H --> R[Explicit command with hashes and all dispositions]
    R --> E{Same source run already recorded?}
    E -->|Identical command| I[Return immutable receipt]
    E -->|Different command| F[Reject conflict]
    E -->|No| V[Lock project, runs and sources; recheck hashes and revisions]
    V -->|Stale or invalid| F
    V --> T[One PostgreSQL transaction]
    T --> O[Three proposed canonical options]
    O --> Q[Human decision with selected/rejected/deferred]
    Q --> A[Audit snapshot and project-bound references]
    A --> I
    T -->|Constraint conflict| B[Rollback all inserts]
    I -.-> N[No auto claims, capabilities or workflow approval]
